1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,121
In this lesson, you'll reply to your
reviews in seconds with Reviews AI,

2
00:00:05,121 --> 00:00:10,192
Kyntlo's built-in assistant that writes
on-brand responses for you to check and

3
00:00:10,192 --> 00:00:10,513
post.

4
00:00:10,513 --> 00:00:13,850
You stay in control, and
you save hours every month.

5
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:16,451
Replying to reviews matters.

6
00:00:16,451 --> 00:00:20,639
It thanks happy customers, it shows
future customers that you care,

7
00:00:20,639 --> 00:00:24,703
and it's your chance to put things
right when someone is unhappy.

8
00:00:24,703 --> 00:00:29,080
The Reviews tab brings every Google
and Facebook review into one list.

9
00:00:29,931 --> 00:00:33,821
Click Needs reply to see only the
reviews you haven't answered yet.

10
00:00:33,821 --> 00:00:35,098
We have three waiting.

11
00:00:35,098 --> 00:00:37,072
These are the ones to clear first.

12
00:00:37,922 --> 00:00:41,731
Before we reply, let's teach
the AI how we like to sound.

13
00:00:41,731 --> 00:00:43,469
Click Reviews AI settings.

14
00:00:44,319 --> 00:00:45,697
First, choose a mode.

15
00:00:45,697 --> 00:00:49,503
Suggestive means the AI drafts
a reply and you approve it.

16
00:00:49,503 --> 00:00:53,178
Auto-pilot means it posts
replies for you automatically.

17
00:00:53,178 --> 00:00:56,591
Start with Suggestive, so
you can see how it writes,

18
00:00:56,591 --> 00:01:00,003
and fine-tune it before you
let it reply on its own.

19
00:01:00,853 --> 00:01:02,105
Then set the voice.

20
00:01:02,105 --> 00:01:06,654
Pick a tone, choose how replies are
signed off, and add instructions.

21
00:01:06,654 --> 00:01:10,807
For example: mention the treatment,
keep it to a few sentences,

22
00:01:10,807 --> 00:01:14,432
and for low ratings, apologise
and invite them to call.

23
00:01:14,432 --> 00:01:15,092
Then save.

24
00:01:15,942 --> 00:01:20,882
Back on Reviews, click Reply on Emma's
five-star review, then Reply with AI.

25
00:01:20,882 --> 00:01:23,483
In a couple of seconds, you have a warm,

26
00:01:23,483 --> 00:01:26,278
personal reply that
mentions her whitening,

27
00:01:26,278 --> 00:01:28,943
and is signed off just the way we set up.

28
00:01:29,792 --> 00:01:33,479
Always read it before you post,
and change anything you like.

29
00:01:33,479 --> 00:01:36,018
When it sounds like you, click Post reply.

30
00:01:36,018 --> 00:01:39,040
It's published on Google
under your business name,

31
00:01:39,040 --> 00:01:41,821
and the review is marked
as replied in Kyntlo.

32
00:01:42,675 --> 00:01:43,830
Now a harder one.

33
00:01:43,830 --> 00:01:47,295
Grace gave three stars
because she waited too long.

34
00:01:47,295 --> 00:01:52,593
Watch how the AI handles it: it thanks
her, apologises without making excuses,

35
00:01:52,593 --> 00:01:55,039
and offers a way to talk it through.

36
00:01:55,888 --> 00:02:01,467
For reviews like this, a real name and a
direct phone number turn a complaint into

37
00:02:01,467 --> 00:02:02,488
a conversation.

38
00:02:02,488 --> 00:02:06,434
The AI already included both,
because of our instructions.

39
00:02:06,434 --> 00:02:07,591
Click Post reply.

40
00:02:08,444 --> 00:02:13,622
Once you trust the replies, you can switch
on Auto-pilot for four and five-star

41
00:02:13,622 --> 00:02:16,899
reviews, and keep handling
lower ratings yourself.

42
00:02:16,899 --> 00:02:21,487
On the Pro plan, AI usage is included,
so there's no charge per reply.

43
00:02:21,487 --> 00:02:24,567
And you can switch back
to Suggestive any time.

44
00:02:25,418 --> 00:02:26,564
Here's a pro tip.

45
00:02:26,564 --> 00:02:29,597
Aim to reply to every
review within two days.

46
00:02:29,597 --> 00:02:32,495
Quick replies show
you're paying attention,

47
00:02:32,495 --> 00:02:37,954
and a thoughtful answer to a bad review
often wins more trust than a page full of

48
00:02:37,954 --> 00:02:38,695
five stars.

49
00:02:38,695 --> 00:02:42,334
Reviews AI makes that easy,
even on your busiest days.

50
00:02:43,209 --> 00:02:44,299
That's Reviews AI!

51
00:02:44,299 --> 00:02:48,902
In the last lesson of this module,
you'll show off your best reviews on your

52
00:02:48,902 --> 00:02:50,658
website with a review widget.

53
00:02:50,658 --> 00:02:51,506
See you there.
